      "content": "That's a really strong start. I love the bit about \"craftsmanship as the true status symbol\"—it's exactly the kind of depth we need.\n\nCan you expand on this? I want you to dive into specific aesthetic directions. Maybe talk about how certain houses are interpreting these \"fluid silhouettes\" or how the \"maximalist texture\" is actually manifesting in the collections. \n\nAgain, just a reminder: keep the focus on the actual trends and analysis. The SEO score is just something the tech team monitors on the backend; if the article feels like it's just mentioning brands for the sake of it, it'll lose all credibility with our readers. Just make it a high-quality, professional report.",
